# A race abandoned before its intro (spec M5): race-start.scenario on into the race with
# Escape held through the race's load, so the race loop's first pass pauses before the intro;
# the box flying in over the black palette, Y, the box flying apart, then the intro run all the
# same and the view tilting away. A shot every 100 ms; the keys held 100 ms or more.
